{
  "_comment": "Loxone Miniserver SYSTEM / PLC / CONFIG / CAN-bus diagnostic commands (jdev/sys, jdev/sps status-only, jdev/cfg, jdev/bus). SOURCES: the project's own docs/loxone/Loxone.postman_collection.json (operator-validated) + a community diagnostics list. NOT the official vendored PDFs. jdev/ = JSON form (dev/ = deprecated XML, interchangeable). This file is ALSO the server-side allow-list: ManagementResource.systemCommand only runs commands present here (exact match, or '<cmd>/<value>' for entries carrying a 'param'). User-management, token and crypto commands are intentionally excluded. Non-jdev resources (data/*, stats, dev/fsget/*) are out of scope (different transport). 'type': ro = read-only (safe), action = real but benign effect, destructive = disruptive/irreversible (UI gates behind a confirm). Reply = the Miniserver's raw LL JSON.",

